OmaMessenger helper — third-party notices
==========================================

This file lists the open-source components built into the oma-messenger-service
helper binary distributed with this release, and the full text of each
component's license.

OmaMessenger's own source is MIT-licensed; see LICENSE in the repository. The
helper binary built for releases also links go.mau.fi/libsignal, which is
GPL-3.0, by way of go.mau.fi/whatsmeow (WhatsApp support). That makes the
combined binary a work covered by the GPL-3.0, whose full text is in
LICENSE-GPL-3.0 next to this file. See the "License" section of the README
for a short summary.

The corresponding source for this binary is the public repository at the
commit tagged for this release: https://github.com/timlittle/omamessenger

This file is generated by `make third-party-notices` (see the Makefile),
using github.com/google/go-licenses/v2 against the ./backend package, which
is what the release binaries build.
