License: MIT No Attribution (SPDX MIT-0)
Source: https://github.com/segmentio/asm/blob/v1.2.1/LICENSE

This module is a dependency of gotd/td (used for Telegram). Its LICENSE file
reads "MIT No Attribution", a permissive variant of MIT that drops the
attribution requirement. go-licenses' classifier does not recognise this
exact text and reports it "Unknown" rather than misidentifying it, so it is
listed here by hand after reading the file directly; it is not a licensing
concern, only a gap in the tool's template database. If this module's
pinned version changes, re-check its LICENSE file still says the same thing.

