English Hunspell dictionaries (en_GB, en_US) 2026.02.25

Bundled for the composer's spell check (backend/internal/spell), embedded
from backend/internal/spell/dictdata/*.gz, unmodified from the en-wl/wordlist
project's release: https://github.com/en-wl/wordlist/releases/tag/rel-2026.02.25
go-licenses does not see these: they are data files gzipped into the
repository, not a Go module dependency. The same three notices are kept
alongside the embedded files themselves, in
backend/internal/spell/dictdata/NOTICE.txt.

